title: "@three-ws/vision-mcp"
abstract: "Let any AI agent see — analyze and describe images through the three.ws vision pipeline. Free NVIDIA NIM VLMs first, with an automatic server-side paid backstop. Pass an image URL or base64 and get a structured, natural-language read. Read-only, no key required."
